## Quick troubleshooting

| Problem | Likely cause & fix |
|---------|-------------------|
| `kubectl get nodes` shows nothing | kubeconfig not set. Run `aws eks update-kubeconfig --name demo-test --region ap-south-1` |
| Pod stuck in `ImagePullBackOff` | Wrong image address in YAML, or Docker not logged in to ECR. Recheck Step 5. |
| Pod stuck in `Pending` | Not enough room on nodes. Raise `--nodes-max` or use a bigger `--node-type`. |
| `EXTERNAL-IP` stays `<pending>` | Wait a few minutes; if it never appears, the cluster may lack the load balancer permissions — check the node IAM role. |
| `exec format error` in logs | Image built for the wrong CPU type. Rebuild with `--platform linux/amd64`. |

