## What to learn next

- **Ingress + AWS Load Balancer Controller** — one shared load balancer for many services (cheaper than one per service).
- **Karpenter or EKS Auto Mode** — smarter, automatic node scaling.
- **Helm** — package your YAML into reusable, versioned charts.
- **IRSA (IAM Roles for Service Accounts)** — let pods talk to AWS services securely without keys.

